<p class="note" style="margin-top:14px">${P("P\u0159id\xE1vejte konektor na webu chatgpt.com, ne v aplikaci: je pak dostupn\xFD v\u0161ude a ChatGPT v n\u011Bm hled\xE1 n\xE1stroje jako prvn\xED. Po zm\u011Bn\u011B pr\xE1v v tokenu dejte v nastaven\xED konektoru Obnovit. Ov\u011B\u0159en\xED nechte na Automatick\xE1, p\u0159i chyb\u011B zvolte DCR.","Add the connector on the chatgpt.com website, not in the app: it is then available everywhere and ChatGPT looks for tools there first. After changing the rights in your token, click Refresh in the connector settings. Leave authentication on Automatic; on an error pick DCR.")}</p>
